// The exe's icon, and through it the desktop shortcut, Explorer, and the
// taskbar: the shell shows the icon resource with the lowest ordinal, so this
// is 1 and there is no second one.
//
// The path is relative to this file. The .ico is baked from the SVGs by
// `cargo xtask bake-icon` and committed, so this is a plain read at build time
// with no rasterizer involved.
1 ICON "../../assets/icon/baked/sunlit-earth.ico"
